{
  "description": "The image-embedded form (Format 14.4): the iTXt chunk with keyword troupe is read whether or not it is compressed; tEXt and zTXt chunks with that keyword are ignored, so they neither hold the bundle nor count as a second chunk; the chunk's language tag and translated keyword are ignored (Format 14.4)",
  "tests": [
    {
      "type": "parse",
      "name": "an uncompressed iTXt chunk",
      "kind": "png",
      "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAAAAAA6fptVAAAAfGlUWHR0cm91cGUAAAAAAHsidHJvdXBlIjoiMC4xMSIsImtpbmQiOiJidW5kbGUiLCJjaGFyYWN0ZXJzIjpbeyJpZCI6Im1pcmEiLCJuYW1lIjoiTWlyYSIsImRlc2NyaXB0aW9uIjoiQSBzdGFyc2hpcCBlbmdpbmVlci4ifV19TpcBtAAAAApJREFUeJxjYAAAAAIAAUivpHEAAAAASUVORK5CYII=",
      "expect": {
        "ok": true,
        "codes": [],
        "equals": {
          "troupe": "0.11",
          "kind": "bundle",
          "characters": [
            {
              "id": "mira",
              "name": "Mira",
              "description": "A starship engineer."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "parse",
      "name": "only a tEXt chunk with keyword troupe",
      "kind": "png",
      "base64": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAAAAAA6fptVAAAAeHRFWHR0cm91cGUAeyJ0cm91cGUiOiIwLjExIiwia2luZCI6ImJ1bmRsZSIsImNoYXJhY3RlcnMiOlt7ImlkIjoibWlyYSIsIm5hbWUiOiJNaXJhIiwiZGVzY3JpcHRpb24iOiJBIHN0YXJzaGlwIGVuZ2luZWVyLiJ9XX0BK6AfAAAACklEQVR4nGNgAAAAAgABSK+kcQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==",
